---
id: "045-huleedu-design-system"
type: "implementation"
created: 2025-12-15
updated: 2026-03-29
scope: "frontend"
references:
  - ADR-0027
  - ADR-0032
  - EPIC-11
  - REF-shared-tool-control-language-v1
