</li>
```

---

## 8. Loading & Empty States

### Loading Spinner

```vue
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 text-navy/60">
  <span class="inline-block w-4 h-4 border-2 border-navy/20 border-t-navy rounded-full animate-spin" />
